  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pathways for Better Education and Livelihoods in Niger</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &apos;Towards Sustainable Education and Livelihoods // Parcours de R&#xe9;ussite Niger: Pour une &#xc9;ducation et des Moyens de Subsistance Durable&apos; aims at supporting displaced children and youth as well as from host communities to access education, livelihood and community engagement opportunities. This project actively seeks to expand opportunities for women and girls, and facilitates for it. To implement these activities, NRC will partner with different entities of the Government of Niger.</narrative>
  </description>
